<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n23097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in-făcētus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infĭc-</span></b> ), a,
		um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>coarse</i>, <i>blunt</i>, <i>rude</i>, <i>unmannerly</i>, <i>not witty</i>, <i>stupid</i>
			(class.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Of persons: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inficetus (homo),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Truc. 2, 4, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Canius nec infacetus, et satis litteratus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 3, 14, 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saeclum (with insipiens),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					43, 8</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Of
			things: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">non inficetum mendacium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Cael. 29, 69</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dictum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Gramm. 23</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. 5, 78, 30</span></i>.— <i>Adv.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infăcētē</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">infĭc-</span></b> ),
				<i>coarsely</i>, <i>rudely</i>, <i>unwittily</i>, <i>stupidly</i> (not
			in Cic. or Cæs.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quem haud infacete Pompeius Xerxem togatum
					vocare assueverat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vell.
					2, 33 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Suet. Vesp. 20</span></i>.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pictus inficetissime Gallus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					35, 4, 8, § 25</span></i>
			.</div>
